<body>

<div class="header-banner">
  <p class="church-subtitle">Pentecostal Missionary Church of Christ (4th Watch) &bull; Davao District</p>
  <h1 class="main-title">Church Digital Assistant &amp; Attendance System</h1>
  <p class="tagline">A Simple Way to Connect Our Church, Share Schedules, and Take Attendance</p>
</div>

<div class="callout-box">
  <strong style="color: #1E281F; font-size: 12pt;">What is this system in simple words?</strong>
  <p style="margin-top: 4pt; margin-bottom: 0;">
    Think of this system as <strong>three helpful tools in one</strong>:
  </p>
  <ul style="margin-bottom: 0;">
    <li><strong>For Members:</strong> An <strong>Official Church Bulletin Board right on your phone</strong>. You can always see upcoming church services, watch online livestreams, and sign attendance with one tap when you arrive at church.</li>
    <li><strong>For Activity Reminders:</strong> An <strong>Automated Church Alert System</strong>. When a special service, fellowship, or district gathering is scheduled, members receive dedicated, visually highlighted notifications with dates, times, and venues so no one misses out.</li>
    <li><strong>For Pastors &amp; Leaders:</strong> A <strong>Digital Church Record Book</strong>. Instead of writing names on paper sign-up sheets and typing them into a computer later, attendance is counted automatically and can be printed or saved to Excel in one click.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<h2>1. The Common Problems We Face Today</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Announcements get lost in group chats:</strong> When we send event schedules on Messenger, they get buried under hundreds of chat messages, stickers, and forwarded videos. Brethren miss church activities simply because they did not see the announcement in time.</li>
  <li><strong>Long lines at the church door:</strong> Brethren have to wait in line to write their names on paper attendance sheets using the same ballpen.</li>
  <li><strong>Paperwork takes too long:</strong> Church secretaries spend hours after every service trying to read handwritten names and tally who was present.</li>
  <li><strong>Paper sheets get lost:</strong> If an attendance paper gets misplaced, the record is gone forever.</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. Special Feature: Never Miss a Church Event (Highlighted Activity Notifications)</h2>

<div class="highlight-box">
  <strong style="color: #5C4B28; font-size: 12pt;">
    <span class="badge-tag">Featured Highlight</span>
    Dedicated Notification &amp; Alert Center for Church Programs
  </strong>
  <p style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;">
    To prevent church announcements from being overlooked in busy social media group chats, the system equips every member with an organized, prioritized notification feed:
  </p>
  <ul style="margin-bottom: 4pt;">
    <li><strong>Distinct Gold Highlight &amp; Badges:</strong> Program and activity notifications are visually spotlighted with an elegant gold left border and an official <em>"Program &amp; Activity"</em> badge, distinguishing them immediately from ordinary administrative notes.</li>
    <li><strong>Event Details at a Glance:</strong> The notification card directly displays the exact scheduled date, time, and venue so brethren do not need to hunt through messages.</li>
    <li><strong>1-Tap "View Event" Button:</strong> Allows members to instantly open the activity details, access online broadcast links, or view venue directions in one touch.</li>
    <li><strong>Category Filter Tabs:</strong> Members can tap the <em>"Programs &amp; Activities"</em> filter pill to view only upcoming church gatherings without having to sift through general announcements.</li>
    <li><strong>Automated Activity Reminders:</strong> The system automatically reminds brethren before an upcoming program begins, ensuring timely arrival and high attendance.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<h2>3. How It Works in 4 Easy Steps</h2>

<table class="step-table">
  <tr>
    <td class="step-num">1</td>
    <td class="step-content">
      <strong>Open the Link on Your Phone</strong><br>
      Members open the church link on their smartphone or computer. There is no need to search Google Play or the Apple App Store. Simply tap <em>"Install App"</em> and an app icon appears on your home screen in 2 seconds.
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="step-num">2</td>
    <td class="step-content">
      <strong>Pick Your Local Church</strong><br>
      Members select their home church (for example: <em>Agdao, Tagum, Digos, or Buhangin</em>). The pastor or administrator confirms them with one tap, creating an accurate church directory.
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="step-num">3</td>
    <td class="step-content">
      <strong>Check Church Schedules &amp; Alerts</strong><br>
      Members receive highlighted event notifications with date, time, and venue, and can watch live service broadcasts directly inside the app without external social media distractions.
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class="step-num">4</td>
    <td class="step-content">
      <strong>Sign Attendance in 3 Seconds</strong><br>
      During church, the pastor flashes a 6-digit number on the screen (or shows a QR code). Members type the code on their phone and tap <em>"Done"</em>. A green checkmark confirms: <strong>"Attendance Recorded!"</strong>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h2>4. What Happens if Someone Doesn't Have a Smartphone?</h2>
<div class="callout-box">
  <p style="margin: 0;">
    We made sure <strong>no one is left behind</strong>: If an elderly member, a child, or someone whose phone battery died attends church, the pastor or church secretary can simply search their name on the church tablet or phone and tap <strong>"Check In"</strong>. Their attendance is counted right away alongside everyone else!
  </p>
</div>

<h2>5. What Church Leaders Get Out of This</h2>

<h3>A. Highlighted Communication That Reaches Brethren</h3>
<p>
  District and locale leadership can publish an activity once, and it immediately notifies all relevant members with clear dates, times, and venues. Members can filter specifically for <strong>"Programs &amp; Activities"</strong>, ensuring church conferences, youth fellowships, and special services get top priority.
</p>

<h3>B. Live Headcount During the Service</h3>
<p>
  As brethren type their code or get checked in, leaders can look at their screen and see the number go up live in real time:<br>
  <em>(Example: "148 brethren present today &bull; 38 from Agdao, 29 from Buhangin, 24 from Tagum...")</em>
</p>

<h3>C. Complete Control</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Start Attendance:</strong> Open attendance when brethren begin arriving.</li>
  <li><strong>Pause Attendance:</strong> Pause it during the sermon so people focus on the Word of God.</li>
  <li><strong>Reopen Attendance:</strong> Open it again for latecomers who arrived after the opening prayer.</li>
  <li><strong>No Duplicates:</strong> The system guarantees that no member can accidentally sign in twice.</li>
</ul>

<h3>D. Official Reports in 1 Click</h3>
<p>
  When the service concludes, the leader taps one button to immediately generate:
</p>
<ul>
  <li>A ready-to-print <strong>PDF paper report</strong> with official church headers and signature lines for district meetings.</li>
  <li>An <strong>Excel spreadsheet (.xlsx)</strong> ready for digital district archiving.</li>
  <li>A <strong>Word document (.docx)</strong> for church office filing and minutes.</li>
</ul>

<h2>6. Why This is Better Than Buying a Regular Mobile App</h2>

<table class="comparison">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 50%;">Regular Mobile Apps</th>
      <th style="width: 50%;">Our Church Digital System</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>Requires members to search and install from Google Play or Apple App Store.</td>
      <td><strong>No app store needed.</strong> Just open the link and tap "Install" in 2 seconds.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Costs hundreds of dollars every year in Apple &amp; Google developer fees.</td>
      <td><strong>Zero app store fees.</strong> Free to run and update anytime.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Takes up a lot of phone storage (50MB to 100MB).</td>
      <td><strong>Very lightweight.</strong> Takes up almost zero phone space.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Often crashes or fails to run on older smartphones.</td>
      <td><strong>Works on any gadget:</strong> Android, iPhone, tablet, laptop, or desktop computer.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Needs fast internet to download and update.</td>
      <td><strong>Works even on slow mobile data.</strong> Uses less data than loading one picture on Facebook.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Announcements get buried under regular social media feeds.</td>
      <td><strong>Dedicated &amp; Highlighted Notifications:</strong> Church events feature gold visual badges, venue details, and category filters.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="callout-box" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20pt;">
  <strong style="font-size: 13pt; color: #1E281F;">Summary in One Sentence</strong><br>
  <span style="font-size: 11pt; color: #303B32;">
    This system removes paper sign-in sheets, highlights church schedules so brethren never miss an event, and gives leaders fast, accurate attendance reports with zero headache.
  </span>
</div>

